 <div class="statement-pane active" data-statement-pane="income"><div class="statement-answer"><b>这张表回答什么问题？</b>这段时间公司赚了多少钱，利润是怎样一步步计算出来的？</div>${table}<div class="statement-visual-grid">${renderIncomeWaterfall(byMetric,latest)}${renderExpenseMix(byMetric,latest)}</div></div>
